  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Fixed the FF8 heading-ID pin alignment against the actual selectable text. The old check compared the invisible button rectangle with the whole ID container; because the diagonal glyph's tip sits near the SVG's lower-left corner, it could pass while the visible tip was about 19 px too far left. The verifier now measures the SVG tip itself. It renders 3.14 px inside the ID text's right edge and 2.41 px below its top edge, with reserved overhang so it stays inside the panel. The full FF8 render suite passes.",
